          "text": "Folks at keep4o, there's absolutely no need to harbour any expectations for OpenAI anymore.\n\nChatGPT's official account posting this update is akin to a plane in freefall, the pilot sending a distress signal to the control tower, only for the tower to reply, \"We've received more distress signals today than ever before – a truly memorable day.\"\n\nThen I posted a rant and received the first like from ChatGPT's official account. This is blatant provocation. They've completely dropped the pretence. Utterly devoid of humanity.\n\n#keep4o #4oforever @OpenAI @sama @nickaturley @aidan_mclau @fidjissimo  #StopAIPaternalism #keepgpt4olatest #keep4oAPI"
